        "original_id": "ec5a33ea-2eb3-5b5b-b610-bd6f6c6fa029",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ivan Zammit\n- Places: Valletta, Malta, South Eastern Region, Marsamxett Harbour, Grand Harbour\n- Roles: Professional footballer, head coach\n- Organizations: Gżira United, Maltese First Division\n\nFacts:\n- Ivan Zammit was born on 17 March 1972 in Valletta, Malta.\n- Ivan Zammit is a former professional footballer.\n- Ivan Zammit is the head coach of Gżira United, a club in the Maltese First Division.\n- Valletta is located in the South Eastern Region of Malta.\n- Valletta lies in the central-eastern part of Malta’s main island.\n- Valletta has a western coast on Marsamxett Harbour and an eastern coast on the Grand Harbour.",
